<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anbeeco cautions it still in talks.</title>
<headline>Anbeeco cautions it still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African watch and clock distributors Anbeeco Investment Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday, referring to an earlier cautionery, it was in talks which could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
